{"id":47323,"date":"2025-12-18T20:57:51","date_gmt":"2025-12-18T19:57:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47323"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:43:25","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:43:25","slug":"mahfra-nature-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/mahfra-nature-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Mahfra Nature Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Trail4U ir\u00e1 organizar a 08 de mar\u00e7o de 2026 pelas 09h00 horas o Mahfra Nature Trail, em Mafra, concelho de Mafra. O Mahfra Nature Trail \u00e9 uma prova de Trail Running, corrida pedestre em Natureza, com tr\u00eas provas, Trail Longo (TL) K24, Trail Curto (TC) 13 e Caminhada. Com partida e chegada na localidade de Mafra, Concelho de Mafra, Distrito de Lisboa, visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o e da promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>A prova Mahfra Nature Trail encontra-se inserida no circuito:<br>&#8211; Mafra Trail Running Series<br>&#8211; Merrell Trail Running Series<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":47325,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47323","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mafra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/pop_gibo0pp931.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\